{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange 9 ideal cards on a page of your grimoire! NOVEMS is an auto-battle deck builder where you collect 9 cards to create your own unique build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__9_.gif?t=1749530488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/deck.png?t=1749530488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your ultimate deck in a world where powerful mages clash. What you discard and what you keep - these choices will determine your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/sample.png?t=1749530488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 'placement' of cards holds the key to victory or defeat. Discern the characteristics of each card and seek the most effective arrangement. Place them strategically to defeat powerful rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/link.png?t=1749530488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards not only have individual effects but can also demonstrate greater power by 'linking' with other cards. Discover hidden synergies and find the strongest combinations to overwhelm your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/strategy.png?t=1749530488\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own tactics from over 50 unique cards and more than 50 link cards. Prove your strength 